flowchart TB
  U[Authenticated user] --> R{Canonical role}
  R --> E[Executive / owner]
  R --> O[Department or operations]
  R --> S[Specialist / frontline]
  R --> P[Portal or external]
  R --> A[Auditor / oversight]
  E --> V1[All or broad module visibility]
  O --> V2[Domain-first landing and operational queues]
  S --> V3[Task-focused workspace and minimum necessary data]
  P --> V4[Scoped records and read-only explanation]
  A --> V5[Read-only evidence and export]
  V1 --> W1[Full write / approval by policy]
  V2 --> W2[Create, edit, submit; checker where assigned]
  V3 --> W3[Operate within limits]
  V4 --> W4[No write or portal-scoped write]
  V5 --> W5[No mutation; immutable audit access]
  W1 --> T[Tenant and company context]
  W2 --> T
  W3 --> T
  W4 --> T
  W5 --> T
  T --> X[Permission state is visible in the UI]
